LOCAL RUN / تشغيل محلي:
    python lunera_spa.py
    Open http://localhost:8000

HOSTING / الرفع:
    Upload this file to a host that supports Python 3.10+.
    Start command: python lunera_spa.py
    The server uses the PORT environment variable when your host supplies it.
    For a WSGI host, the application callable is lunera_spa:app.
